# ===== Installation Notes =====
# 
# 1. Silero VAD (install from source):
#    pip install git+https://github.com/snakers4/silero-vad.git
#
# 2. Pyannote Audio (requires HuggingFace token):
#    pip install pyannote.audio
#    # Then accept user agreement at: https://huggingface.co/pyannote/speaker-diarization
#    # Set token: export HF_TOKEN="your_token_here"
#
# 3. emotion2vec (install from source):
#    pip install git+https://github.com/ddlBoJack/emotion2vec.git
#
# 4. For GPU support (recommended for diarization & emotion2vec):
#    pip install torch torchaudio --index-url https://download.pytorch.org/whl/cu118
#
# 5. For M1/M2 Mac (Apple Silicon):
#    # TensorFlow works via conda or pip (universal2 wheels available)
#    # PyTorch has native MPS support
#
# 6. For production deployment:
#    - Pin all versions exactly (use pip freeze)
#    - Generate model hashes for reproducibility
#    - Test on target hardware
